                <pb facs="1171" n="1075" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1075"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 5.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Nunes to Mr. Schmitt.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-07"><hi rendition="#small-caps">November</hi> 7,
                            1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>English war-steamer Niobe left for Santiago last night 7 o’clock. In absence of
                    American steamer ask her captain to protect American interests connected with
                    Virginius.</p>
            </div>
